The server is thought to be accessed through http via reverse proxy managing SSL.
HTTPS accesses are commented.

The server is written for node.js

The msConvert part requires Wine and Mono
Install notes:
-Wine needs to be installed for users, not root. Simply get any package up to date
-Mono needs to be downloaded before installation, select the latest .msi and run wine msiexec -i XXX.msi
-Run wine msconvert.exe to set the correct prefix
